      56.66,
      118.64,
      514.15,
      172.25
    ],
    "text": "Bulletin No: 06 MSW /26/11/01/02 COLOR: Red Warning for strong winds and rough seas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      15.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      172.82,
      399.96,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 03.00 p.m. 01 November 2026, valid for the next 24 hours. For: Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      237.26,
      553.75,
      325.01
    ],
    "text": "Deep sea areas off the coast extending from Mannar to Trincomalee via Kankasanthurai. Take Action! The Deep Depression over the Southeast Bay of Bengal has intensified into a Cyclone and named as \u2018MURASU\u2019. The system was located near latitude 12.1\u00b0N and longitude 85.3\u00b0E at 11.30 a.m. on 01 November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      333.65,
      555.67,
      396.17
    ],
    "text": "Cyclone Murasu is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify further into a Severe Cyclonic Storm over West-central Bay of Bengal around 2nd November morning. Thereafter it is very likely to move northwestwards and cross Andhra Pradesh coast to India as a Severe Cyclonic Storm during midnight of 2nd to early hours of 3rd November, 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      406.97,
      555.6,
      452.71
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category in the map below, may increase to (70-80) kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and these sea areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      463.63,
      555.62,
      509.23
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-15N and 80E-90E, until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      520.15,
      555.67,
      583.06
    ],
    "text": "Also, naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep sea areas off the coast extending from Mannar to Trincomalee via Kankasanthurai until further notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      896.04,
      553.8,
      958.56
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea area are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
